    },
    {
      "action": "retained",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "01b420cd219328d0843f3a8ed363543273a5eef67e982e5f142e7eef07269651",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: What the product looks like today is you open the app and you can find a space to leave your things all over the city. So the goal is on every block of the city.",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_founder",
      "source_turn_index": 1,
      "speaker": "Cody",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "removed",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "89e4b4414775d20941d51ebfae0f7c9fc85851dc35b910b2082468c5f94fdee9",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "removed non-founder, evaluative, or unnecessary context",
      "rendered_text": "",
      "retained_content_class": null,
      "source_turn_index": 2,
      "speaker": "Nicole",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "retained",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "e4aba05b579cb919bd59dd28f06e7dca8a6122a4a2ab504febf79d493897a17e",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: Yeah, that's right. So a lot of travelers will use us to store their luggage. A lot of folks will use us before going to, say, an event at Madison Square Garden. All kinds of use cases.",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_founder",
      "source_turn_index": 3,
      "speaker": "Cody",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "removed",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "3d72203c4be557bc5693a6d71b33dcec8ca001c6e8f113286ad6e539976344ce",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "removed non-founder, evaluative, or unnecessary context",
      "rendered_text": "",
      "retained_content_class": null,
      "source_turn_index": 4,
      "speaker": "Jillian",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "removed",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "a1d0e4aee460f1a616edd98a0efa5f8b3d8d38c6fa5c198d538f208d808b741e",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "removed non-founder, evaluative, or unnecessary context",
      "rendered_text": "",
      "retained_content_class": null,
      "source_turn_index": 5,
      "speaker": "Nicole",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "retained",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "da22bd94b9c9907330a8a623788e13996eb4a48f1def28ff1688b9efa15fa706",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer; removed 1 unattributed continuation line(s)",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: Yeah, so we’re storing things in small businesses that have extra space. We have 65 store locations between New York City and San Francisco.",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_founder",
      "source_turn_index": 6,
      "speaker": "Cody",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 1
    },
    {
      "action": "neutralized",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "0cdf7354ac9ba2d644d900f8f06fa977145cb1402b317d8ad81fef7450c9c1d9",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "neutralized investor question",
      "rendered_text": "Investor question: You’re enabling people to store things temporarily?",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_investor_question",
      "source_turn_index": 7,
      "speaker": "Phil",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "retained",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "e75e93714579140c669f2f81cf5799c17720d240f8afb9a57860b8ba6d5f0748",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: That’s right.",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_founder",
      "source_turn_index": 8,
      "speaker": "Cody",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "neutralized",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "8bdc3d62b9f15acd2664d1af3c97f1d657e28c8edd0a0ed2e8d838f39e53382b",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "neutralized investor question",
      "rendered_text": "Investor question: What kind of revenue are you generating? How does it all work?",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_investor_question",
      "source_turn_index": 9,
      "speaker": "Michael",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "retained",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "bcde2d18acca3d482ba80ccc1529e70df6a76a0e71b3cddf33d721502e174f0b",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: So there’s two value props for the stores. One is extra foot traffic. Our customers, we estimate more than half of them buy from our small business partners. The second value prop is we do a revenue share with them. So basically we charge $6 per bag per day with the current model, and we give $3 now phasing that to $2 per bag to the store partners. So they win on both of those value props.",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_founder",
      "source_turn_index": 10,
      "speaker": "Cody",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "neutralized",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "26361f3f1433d09bfefdd4bb3c5109f0591ffcfb45d2669e65da361a6bdbb82d",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "neutralized investor question",
      "rendered_text": "Investor question: And is the $6 charge regardless of the size of the item?",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_investor_question",
      "source_turn_index": 11,
      "speaker": "Phil",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "retained",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "09dfe721cd76650fc87410bde9b9d4280f8cc6b11223d4d08ada2648e5e51b39",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: That’s right. As long as you can pick it up with two hands. So we do backpacks, suitcases, work bags, gym bags, all kinds of things.",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_founder",
      "source_turn_index": 12,
      "speaker": "Cody",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "neutralized",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "acd309d6217b06b719c14ae54cf75405fe00058ab65e323597a1b68e145f5551",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "neutralized investor question",
      "rendered_text": "Investor question: How long have you been doing this for?",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_investor_question",
      "source_turn_index": 13,
      "speaker": "Michael",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "retained",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "9dfaca69c3c64ac21ef6aed7ea4f1e43510f043a0e3e82c58533e8afd8ee202a",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: We started last October.",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_founder",
      "source_turn_index": 14,
      "speaker": "Cody",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "neutralized",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "b5ad03bdf51d7da50d415f8ee278ad322675ac4cab3dc46669b8c0669c62fa88",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "neutralized investor question",
      "rendered_text": "Investor question: And how fast are you scaling on revenue? What’s going on?",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_investor_question",
      "source_turn_index": 15,
      "speaker": "Michael",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "retained",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "1d9877b5b090dd9e9486dcf5dc27b5eeb58cf3d470455b34dfea096a9d2330b1",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer; removed 1 unattributed continuation line(s)",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: So basically we’ve been in product development mode, came out of that in February, and since then we’ve been growing 50% month over month. So last month we did $8,500 in revenue.",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_founder",
      "source_turn_index": 16,
      "speaker": "Cody",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 1
    },
    {
      "action": "retained",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "1ef45f6b78538c75552956f18c6f0c14d1ffa2267310af309b9829850d86d905",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: So in addition to the money, one of the things we’re looking for in this investment around is partnerships. So folks who have a lot of retail connections and they can help us flip some of these connections really, really fast.",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_founder",
      "source_turn_index": 17,
      "speaker": "Cody",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "removed",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "86844be591fd26e6ad1155dc2e4889a8effc44af04c16c4b167e5a727d11f88e",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "removed non-founder, evaluative, or unnecessary context",
      "rendered_text": "",
      "retained_content_class": null,
      "source_turn_index": 18,
      "speaker": "Jillian",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "retained",
      "attributed_source_line_index": 0,
      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "09cc6c442bcade3cde17efaa28418523eb8bbfab5f447e74b7610b0ea8b12116",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: If we could get one of these big guys…",
      "retained_content_class": "explicit_founder",
      "source_turn_index": 19,
      "speaker": "Cody",
      "unattributed_continuation_count": 0
    },
    {
      "action": "removed",
