      "attributed_source_line_sha256": "b59970ed53c99ac7b168d7f746f28978177a5d133aba030b3b73c9c0a9044698",
      "preceded_by_investor_decision": false,
      "reason": "founder pitch or pre-decision factual answer",
      "rendered_text": "Cody: They’re losing all their customers. And so they’re desperate for traffic. So they come to us and UPS. They have all kinds of add-on services, like passport photos, and fingerprinting services. They’re looking for these add-on businesses.",
